"203819440", "author": {"steamid": "76561198283194298", "personaname": "szn ジ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kuefo/", "num_games_owned": 1441, "num_reviews": 312, "playtime_forever": 157, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 157, "last_played": 1757301247, "avatar": "071114c8b4ae5a512d4aaafae01baa45882cfc82"}, "language": "english", "review": "it's really fun, i like the art style, the enemies are somewhat challenging, but not too hard (i played canyons on easy difficulty and it took me like 3 tries to beat). the game pretty much reminds me of borderlands and risk of rain combined, but i love both of those games so i don't mind. \n\nedit: difficulty definitely starts to ramp up, but i beat the first boss in the oasis area, and died in the fields. i'm really enjoying the combat system in this game so far, as well as the different roguelite elements \n\nthe intro cut scenes are also really well done, it literally felt like i was watching comic book panels which i honestly enjoyed. not enough games use that art style, and i'm glad to see this one does it correctly. \n\nso yeah, overall i recommend this game, pick it up while it's on sale or something.", "timestamp_created": 1757270319, "timestamp_updated": 1757301342, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.533476173877716064", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "203790249", "author": {"steamid": "76561197975915736", "personaname": "Cyb3rKn1ght", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Cyb3rKn1ght/", "num_games_owned": 314, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 5881, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1948, "last_played": 1788545431, "avatar": "95d8f1c00bbdc43e289e494f3dad027a6